DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
SUMMARY:Deadline: Playful Obscura 2027: Arthouse Games Residency Africa (Ad
 dis Ababa\, Goethe-Institut and A MAZE.)
DESCRIPTION:Playful Obscura is the Goethe-Institut's arthouse games residen
 cy for Africa\, co-run with the Berlin playful-media festival A MAZE. Afte
 r editions in Ho (2025) and Accra (2026)\, the third edition moves to Addi
 s Ababa with Creative HUB Ethiopia\, the British Council and Alliance Ethi
 o-Francaise.\n\nOrganisation: Goethe-Institut Addis Abeba\, with Creative 
 HUB Ethiopia\, A MAZE.\, British Council and Alliance Ethio-Francaise\nLoc
 ation: Addis Ababa\, Ethiopia. For artists and game developers based in Af
 rica working in playful media and arthouse games.\nAward: Three-week funde
 d residency hosting two artists at a time. 2027 financial terms were not p
 ublished in the call excerpt we could verify\; the 2026 Accra edition prov
 ided accommodation\, a production budget of up to EUR 1\,000 and a EUR 300
  stipend. No application fee.\nDuration: Residency 25 January to 14 Februa
 ry 2027 in Addis Ababa\; open call 16 October to 1 November 2026\, with an
  online Q&A on 22 October.\n\nMore: https://www.goethe.de/ins/za/en/kul/mu
 t/p27.html?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.goethe.de/ins/za/en/kul/mut/p27.html?utm_source=artificialn
 ouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Addis Ababa\, Ethiopia. For artists and game developers based in A
 frica working in playful media and arthouse games.
END:VEVENT
